{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/878","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/878/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/878/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/878/events","html_url":"https://github.com/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/878","id":5823428258,"node_id":"I_kwDORhCjFc8AAAABWxp2og","number":878,"title":"12 MAPPED labels resolve to an identity with a different hydrate; the MgSO4·H2O record sits on the heptahydrate","user":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-13T02:24:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-15T04:32:46Z","closed_at":"2026-10-15T04:32:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Found from CultureBotAI/CultureMech#597, using CultureMech's `label_hydrate_count` (CultureMech#591) over the label index at `6643131b`. These are **MAPPED** rows, MIM's curated answers. CultureMech honours MAPPED answers and does not override them, so they can only be fixed here.\n\nEach row's label states an explicit hydrate count. Its identifier's count comes from the index itself: the identity's `ontology_label` rows when they state one, otherwise its MAPPED preferred terms. Recipe rows are occurrences in CultureMech `41d4d39`.\n\n## A. Wrong identity: label hydrate ≠ identity hydrate (12 rows)\n\n| label | label states | identifier | identity states | recipe rows |\n|---|---|---|---|---:|\n| `NaH2PO4 x H2O` | 1 | kgmicrobe.compound:nah2po4_x_2_h2o | 2 | 34 |\n| `NaH2PO4·H2O` | 1 | kgmicrobe.compound:nah2po4_x_2_h2o | 2 | 1 |\n| `NaH2PO4・H2O` | 1 | kgmicrobe.compound:nah2po4_x_2_h2o | 2 | 1 |\n| `MgSO4·H2O` | 1 | CHEBI:31795 | 7 (ontology label \"magnesium sulfate heptahydrate\") | 2 |\n| `magnesium sulfate anhydrous` | 0 | CHEBI:31795 | 7 | 0 |\n| `Magnesium chloride anhydrous` | 0 | CHEBI:86345 | 6 (ontology label \"magnesium dichloride hexahydrate\") | 0 |\n| `sodium sulfate, anhydrous` | 0 | CHEBI:32586 | 10 | 0 |\n| `Anhydrous sodium sulfite` | 0 | CHEBI:86477 | 5 | 0 |\n| `Sodium sulfite anhydrous` | 0 | CHEBI:86477 | 5 | 0 |\n| `copper(II) nitrate (anhydrous)` | 0 | kgmicrobe.compound:cu_no32_x_3_h2o | 3 | 0 |\n| `Cystein-HCl x 2 H2O (5% (w/v))` | 2 | CHEBI:91248 | 1 | 0 |\n| `sodium monohydrogen phosphate dihydrat` | 2 | kgmicrobe.ingredient:disodium_phosphate_heptahydrate_~28002_m_stock~29 | 7 | 0 |\n\nThe three NaH2PO4 rows are already #758. Rows with 0 recipe rows are latent: they do not affect CultureMech today, but any recipe that uses those spellings would get the wrong hydrate.\n\n## B. One misnamed record: the `MgSO4·H2O` record sits on CHEBI:31795\n\nA MIM record whose preferred term is `MgSO4·H2O` is grounded to CHEBI:31795 (ontology label \"magnesium sulfate heptahydrate\"). It owns 12 heptahydrate synonyms, so those identities are right and only the record's name contradicts them:\n- `MgSO4.7H2O` (23 recipe rows)\n- `magnesium sulphate heptahydrate` (1)\n- `magnesium sulfate heptahydrate`, `magnesium sulfate (1:1) heptahydrate`, `sulfuric acid magnesium salt heptahydrate`, `.MgSO4 x 7 H2O`, `MgSO x 7 H2O`, `MgSO2 x 7 H2O`, `MgSO4x7H2O`, and three `MgSO4•7H2O (...)` product spellings (0 each)\n\nEither the record is a heptahydrate record with a wrong name, or it is a monohydrate record with a wrong grounding that has collected heptahydrate synonyms. In the second case, the `MgSO4·H2O` label (section A) and these synonyms belong on different records. `build_culturemech_membership.py` already flags this record (\"a monohydrate inherits the heptahydrate's memberships\").\n\n## Not a defect\n\n`Ceftriaxone disodium salt hemiheptahydrate` → record `Ceftriaxone disodium salt hemi(heptahydrate)` showed up only as a CultureMech parser false positive: the parenthesised prefix is read as \"heptahydrate\".\n\n## Related\n\n- #811: tombstone cross-hydrate redirects. CultureMech#591 now refuses those on its side; this issue covers the MAPPED cases it cannot.\n- #758: NaH2PO4 monohydrate\n- #877: membership rebuild\n\n\n\n\n## Resolution (2026-10-15)\n\n- **Fixed:** PR #881 (merged as 3751d80f) handles rows 4-12 and regrounds `MgSO4·H2O` to `cas:14168-73-1`.\n- **Rows 1-3 not fixed here:** the NaH2PO4 monohydrate spellings stay with #758.\n- **Follow-ups:** #894, #896 and #900-#904.\n","closed_by":{"login":"realmarcin","id":4625870,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MjU4NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4625870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin","html_url":"https://github.com/realmarcin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/realmarcin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/878/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/CultureBotAI/MediaIngredientMech/issues/878/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}